      "value": "<p>A redundant field generator that holds a reserve charge dedicated to emergency barrier restoration, dumping it straight into the projectors the moment they fall offline.</p><p>This module removes your kinetic barrier's recharge delay <em>and</em> allows it to begin recharging from full depletion (0 HP) <strong>without Taking Cover</strong>. Your barrier resumes recharging on your next turn regardless of cover or recent damage.</p><p><strong>Activate</strong> - Install in armor during a 10-minute field maintenance procedure.</p><hr/><p><em>Installation: Drag it onto armor in your inventory to install it. Its bonus applies while the armor it is installed in is worn. </em></p>"
